---
// copied from the one-page site; edit freely
---
<!-- AUDIENCE TABS -->
<section class="aud" id="join">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="label">Get involved</p>

    <div class="tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Choose who you are">
      <button class="tab" role="tab" id="t-students" aria-controls="p-students" aria-selected="true">Students</button>
      <button class="tab" role="tab" id="t-mentors" aria-controls="p-mentors" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1">Mentors</button>
      <button class="tab" role="tab" id="t-story" aria-controls="p-story" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1">Storytellers</button>
      <button class="tab" role="tab" id="t-fund" aria-controls="p-fund" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1">Funders &amp; partners</button>
    </div>

    <div class="panel" role="tabpanel" id="p-students" aria-labelledby="t-students">
      <div>
        <h3>What students get</h3>
        <p class="intro">The goal is not to graduate. Try new fields, see how design really works, and take something useful back into your life.</p>
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/workshops/">Explore workshops &amp; talks <span class="arr">→</span></a>
      </div>
      <div class="gets">
        <div class="get"><b>Try new fields</b><span>Without long-term commitment</span></div>
        <div class="get"><b>Understand disciplines</b><span>How different design fields and processes actually work</span></div>
        <div class="get"><b>Discover directions</b><span>Interests, hobbies, possible careers</span></div>
        <div class="get"><b>See learning differently</b><span>Active, playful and personal</span></div>
        <div class="get"><b>Work with real tools</b><span>Materials, processes and decisions</span></div>
        <div class="get"><b>Build confidence</b><span>Through doing, not just listening</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="panel" role="tabpanel" id="p-mentors" aria-labelledby="t-mentors" hidden>
      <div>
        <h3>What mentors get</h3>
        <p class="intro">You learned through practice, mistakes and obsession. Teach the same way, to people who want to hear how it really happened.</p>
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/#contact" data-who="Mentor">Become a mentor <span class="arr">→</span></a>
      </div>
      <div class="groups">
        <div><h4>Platform &amp; presence</h4><ul><li>Share your experience and personal journey</li><li>Present your work to a new audience</li><li>Build your personal or professional brand</li><li>Become part of a creative cultural movement</li></ul></div>
        <div><h4>Teaching &amp; impact</h4><ul><li>Teach through practice, not theory only</li><li>Create meaningful content from the sessions</li><li>Connect with future collaborators and clients</li><li>Discover potential students or assistants</li></ul></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="panel" role="tabpanel" id="p-story" aria-labelledby="t-story" hidden>
      <div>
        <h3>Hiveworx is a stage</h3>
        <p class="intro">Not every mentor runs a workshop. Some just take the stage. Hiveworx is a stage as much as a studio: a place to share your journey.</p>
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/#contact" data-who="Other">Pitch a talk <span class="arr">→</span></a>
      </div>
      <div class="groups">
        <div><h4>Your story</h4><ul><li>How you started</li><li>What you learned by yourself</li><li>What mistakes shaped you</li></ul></div>
        <div><h4>Your craft</h4><ul><li>How you built your craft</li><li>What tools, books or moments changed you</li><li>Why your work matters</li></ul></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="panel" role="tabpanel" id="p-fund" aria-labelledby="t-fund" hidden>
      <div>
        <h3>Support a new creative education platform</h3>
        <p class="intro">Your support funds talks and workshops from real practitioners behind famous products, events, designs, exhibitions, film and music.</p>
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/#contact" data-who="Funder">Partner with us <span class="arr">→</span></a>
      </div>
      <div class="gets">
        <div class="get"><b>Creative education</b><span>Delivered through practice, not lectures</span></div>
        <div class="get"><b>Content &amp; visibility</b><span>Documented, shareable, cultural</span></div>
        <div class="get"><b>Future talent</b><span>A pipeline for the creative economy</span></div>
        <div class="get"><b>Community building</b><span>Connecting people, makers, brands and institutions</span></div>
        <div class="get"><b>Youth development</b><span>Empowering the next generation</span></div>
        <div class="get"><b>Local creative industry</b><span>Embedded in the local ecosystem</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
